# i18n

- User-facing strings use translation **keys** only — no hardcoded UI copy in components
- Auth + ApiError catalogs live in `@repo/i18n` and stay aligned with `@repo/contracts` error keys
- Resolve API failures with `errorKey` → i18n → fallback locale → generic
- New locales = new resource files + registration (wizard later); do not fork copy into components
